{"qid": "Q46", "verdict": "no", "answer": "不是。江坂把古董店交给瑚太朗时明确说过，适当卖掉点就可以，卖不掉也不要紧，并没有获利的必要，只要维持住长年在这个地方开着店这个事实就好。", "evidence_rfids": [[10090, 10129]], "all_citations_valid": true, "half": "B", "type": "yesno", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 72147, "completion_tokens": 70, "total_tokens": 72217, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 71936, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 211}, "latency_ms": 1072, "n_attempts": 1, "local_cache_hit": true, "cost_usd_offpeak": 0.00028946, "cost_usd_peak": 0.00057892, "request_hash": "12ac0564fccaf6e0ce85ee2b775001d236c9812beee9be21283b0904fd696388"}
{"qid": "Q47", "verdict": "yes", "answer": "查明了。加岛樱对瑚太朗说，她能够追溯接近自己的魔物的契约线，并据此指出书信是瑚太朗送的。", "evidence_rfids": [[10436, 10486]], "all_citations_valid": true, "half": "B", "type": "yesno", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 72149, "completion_tokens": 59, "total_tokens": 72208, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 71936, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 213}, "latency_ms": 924, "n_attempts": 1, "local_cache_hit": true, "cost_usd_offpeak": 0.00028316, "cost_usd_peak": 0.00056632, "request_hash": "816b105e5305c022c7f215324e0fdc289d6ecc67fbc3fd6fc32dcdef617676d4"}
{"qid": "Q48", "verdict": "yes", "answer": "是。瑚太朗在建设中的地铁隧道里遇到与埋伏魔物苦战的守护者小队，用吹箭和注射器狙击危险个体，并在吹箭用尽后亲自用匕首扑杀魔物；扫尾后生存者只剩4名，他随后把今宫和西九条等人领到入口处逃出。", "evidence_rfids": [[13848, 13873], [13874, 13877], [13878, 13886], [13952, 13996]], "all_citations_valid": true, "half": "B", "type": "yesno", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 72149, "completion_tokens": 123, "total_tokens": 72272, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 71936, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 213}, "latency_ms": 2018, "n_attempts": 1, "local_cache_hit": true, "cost_usd_offpeak": 0.00032156, "cost_usd_peak": 0.00064312, "request_hash": "84190c8399451794ba59b0608aba371461a6a109187bcfa4b63bbe7cfbe030e8"}
{"qid": "Q49", "verdict": "no", "answer": "没有。证据中洲崎明确说「这里没有城市基础设施，水和电都没有」，必要的东西只能靠人力和魔物运送。", "evidence_rfids": [[9612, 9650]], "all_citations_valid": true, "half": "B", "type": "yesno", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 72151, "completion_tokens": 55, "total_tokens": 72206, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 71936, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 215}, "latency_ms": 989, "n_attempts": 1, "local_cache_hit": true, "cost_usd_offpeak": 0.00028106, "cost_usd_peak": 0.00056212, "request_hash": "4a718436ba6827b1fa98b885f7ddd2690471d838201e577f2c5f5c66453e6965"}
{"qid": "Q50", "verdict": "no", "answer": "不是。证据显示篝最初与瑚太朗交谈时语言能力有限，后来逐渐学习人类语言，到后期反而恶化到无法自如讲话（如「篝已经无法自如地讲话了」），并非第一次开口就能正常交谈。", "evidence_rfids": [[9866, 9917], [12037, 12093]], "all_citations_valid": true, "half": "B", "type": "yesno", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 72148, "completion_tokens": 79, "total_tokens": 72227, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 71936, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 212}, "latency_ms": 1360, "n_attempts": 1, "local_cache_hit": true, "cost_usd_offpeak": 0.00029501, "cost_usd_peak": 0.00059002, "request_hash": "a5f683cd397dda858bed2dca2b20fb1a9ace2f789f4f2df433f65ab99b6da324"}
{"qid": "Q51", "verdict": "no", "answer": "没有。得知瑚太朗是叛徒后，清水下令处决他，今宫并未下令处决，反而请求在处决前先问瑚太朗一个问题。", "evidence_rfids": [[13747, 13789], [13791, 13813]], "all_citations_valid": true, "half": "B", "type": "yesno", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 72149, "completion_tokens": 72, "total_tokens": 72221, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 71936, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 213}, "latency_ms": 1348, "n_attempts": 1, "local_cache_hit": true, "cost_usd_offpeak": 0.00029096, "cost_usd_peak": 0.00058192, "request_hash": "0ab8e2cda45abd4b077cbfcc1797f24f2f616ce610fba604ff36e9bdaad99eb4"}
{"qid": "Q52", "verdict": "yes", "answer": "有。瑚太朗在潜入盖亚与守护者双方后，刻意在两组织间制造摩擦：他一边泄露守护者的警备情况，一边把魔物的动向泄漏给守护者，使森林对两个组织都变得不稳；他还用吹箭射杀盖亚的侦查型魔物，并在离原区域约10公里的地方继续狩猎魔物，以引发更大反应；在守护者与盖亚的搜索队冲突中，他通过契约线唤醒待命的使魔袭击守护者先头小队，诱使守护者尾随报复，从而让双方大打出手。", "evidence_rfids": [[10152, 10178], [10932, 10956], [10957, 10981], [11199, 11220], [11221, 11246]], "all_citations_valid": true, "half": "B", "type": "yesno", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 72154, "completion_tokens": 183, "total_tokens": 72337, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 71936, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 218}, "latency_ms": 2662, "n_attempts": 1, "local_cache_hit": true, "cost_usd_offpeak": 0.00035831, "cost_usd_peak": 0.00071662, "request_hash": "87eacb62fd5c6595e0bd091bf5ec4d13220b44706e8c2a3e584f6a8581eeaaee"}
{"qid": "Q53", "verdict": "yes", "answer": "有。证据显示篝的树木化与圣歌队的歌声相关：瑚太朗发现篝身体痉挛、指尖裂开长出叶子、丝带枯萎崩坏，判断“是因为…这首歌的吗？”，并想到圣歌队成员若都是精选的魔物使，其歌声即对生命的有机干涉，因此认定“必须将这首歌停下来”，否则篝的衰弱与混乱不会停止。", "evidence_rfids": [[13350, 13369], [13371, 13391], [13724, 13745]], "all_citations_valid": true, "half": "B", "type": "yesno", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 72146, "completion_tokens": 128, "total_tokens": 72274, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 71936, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 210}, "latency_ms": 1536, "n_attempts": 1, "local_cache_hit": true, "cost_usd_offpeak": 0.00032411, "cost_usd_peak": 0.00064822, "request_hash": "167b34f8bd93957818ddbe7ffcadf031552a105ee596340ed245e6a51b1b5a8e"}
